# Only the live website is published to GitHub. Everything else in this
# folder (copy doc, archive, design comps, unused photos) stays local.
# When the site starts using a new photo, add a matching "!/Pics/..." line.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/CNAME
!/Pics/
/Pics/*
!/Pics/Bussa 2.JPG
!/Pics/Farmers Market.jpg
!/Pics/Soursop.jpg
!/Pics/headshot 3.jpg
!/Pics/Sugarcane and mill 2.jpg
